Service Binding Name : ZUIS_VBAK_O4
Binding Type         : OData V4 - UI
Service Definition   : ZUIS_VBAK
Migrated from        : ZD_SD_ALV

─── Activation Steps (ADT / SAP BTP ABAP Environment) ───────────────────────

1. Open ADT → your BTP ABAP project.
2. File → New → Other → ABAP → Business Services → Service Binding
     Name        : ZUIS_VBAK_O4
     Description : ZD SD ALV OData V4 UI binding
     Binding Type: OData V4 - UI
     Service Def : ZUIS_VBAK
3. Click "Publish" to activate the binding.
4. Under "Service Version 0001" expand entity set "VBAK".
5. Click "Preview" → Fiori Elements List Report launches.

─── Service URL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/sap/opu/odata4/sap/zuis_vbak_o4/0001/

